# TK-UI Frontend (System Under Test)

**Repo:** `C:\Users\gigam\IdeaProjects\tk-ui`  
**Package name:** `cpm-erp`  
**Stack:** React 19, TypeScript, Vite 7, React Router 7, Tailwind 4, shadcn/Radix, Axios, React Hook Form + Zod

## Auth flow (matches erp-auto-test)

```
SPA load → GET /users/me (cookies)
  → 401 → redirect backend /login?redirectUri=<origin>
  → Keycloak #username, #password, #kc-login
  → session cookie → SPA loads
```

Home `/` redirects to **first permitted sidebar route** (often `/production`).

