## UI test constraints

- **`data-testid`: none** — ask frontend team to add before UI CRUD tests
- Selectors today: Ukrainian text, placeholders, Tailwind classes — **fragile**
- **RBAC:** sidebar items gated by permissions; write actions blocked when "Всі локації" selected
- Locale: Ukrainian throughout

