## UI test strategy

- **Keep:** login smoke, production landing smoke (after ProductionPage fix)
- **Defer:** create/edit wizards, relocations, plans UI — until `data-testid`
- **API covers:** dictionary CRUD (resources, storage, units), production business logic

When adding UI tests: prefer `data-testid` in tk-ui first, then update Page Objects in `com.erp.pages`.
